  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support for Strengthening Public Health Emergency Preparedness and Response in Mozambique is a component of Improving Reproductive Maternal and Child Health (RMCH) outcomes in Mozambique reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;2,950,081. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management, Infectious disease control, Basic health care.</narrative>
